# Cloudflare Pages headers for the demo (notzero-demo → demo.getnotzero.com).
# app.js has a fixed (unhashed) filename, so cache it but always revalidate — otherwise a deploy takes up to
# 4h to reach repeat visitors. `no-cache` = use the cache only after a 304 check, so it's instant yet efficient.
/app.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
